&gt;handover (UC-03), row 4 the closing stock count (UC-04) and row 5 the manager reports.&lt;br&gt;Each process runs left to right from the Main Menu. Solid arrows are the main flow.&lt;br&gt;Screens with a red title are exception screens; dashed arrows are the alternative flows from&lt;br&gt;the CW1 use case extensions.&lt;br&gt;Every arrow is labelled with the button or condition that causes the move. Click a screen to&lt;br&gt;open its page." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#c9b800;fontColor=#222222;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="110" width="700" height="250" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="S01" name="S01 Login"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1200" pageHeight="640" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="S01_1" value="Low-fidelity prototype · Safia Branch Management System · S01 Login" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#222222;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;rounded=0;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="760" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><UserObject label="‹ Back to flow map" link="data:page/id,MAP" id="S01_2"><mxCell style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#e3f0ff;strokeColor=#3b73b9;fontColor=#1f4e8c;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1040" y="22" width="130" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><mxCell id="S01_3" value="" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#ffffff;str